[OUTValidator]
FriendlyName="OpenUT2k4 Validator"
Description="Identifies OpenUT2k4 players by their player key (stable, unforgeable id for bans), probation for new keys, combined bans, server-side sanity checks. Real UT2004 clients are not challenged."
